cp $15
jr nz, .notSSAnne5Warp
scf
jr IsWarpTileInFrontOfPlayer.done
.notSSAnne5Warp
and a
jr IsWarpTileInFrontOfPlayer.done
IsPlayerStandingOnDoorTileOrWarpTile::
